# lintian (from trixie on) raises license-problem-php-license as an
# ERROR for any PHP-licensed software that is not the PHP interpreter
# itself; sid's lintian did not emit it. The PHP License 3.01 is the
# deliberate, documented licensing decision of this project (AGENTS.md,
# "Licenza"; debian/copyright keeps the canonical text), so the tag is
# overridden at source level: the --fail-on error gate of the CI lane
# (.github/workflows/debian-packages.yml) stays meaningful on every
# suite without special-casing the build distro.
license-problem-php-license
